/**
 * High-resolution, locally bundled provider marks.
 *
 * Android often scales source badges above their source pixel size on dense
 * screens. These 128px marks keep the logos crisp while remaining offline and
 * deterministic; SourceLogo supplies the shared optical frame and fallback.
 */
